CLAUDE.*.md
# Ignore .claude/ except the two shipped skills — config/preset writing
# guides live here and ship with the init template. Other personal
# skills (tdd, etc.) stay ignored. The two entries below intentionally
# omit trailing slashes so they match symlinks as well as directories —
# the repo uses symlinks into templates/.claude/skills/ to avoid
# duplication.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/writing-data-transfer-config
!.claude/skills/writing-data-transfer-preset
.sample/
.transfer/
coverage/

